prompt: "Blocky low-poly fantasy game scene, 16:9, bright daylight. A hooded blocky adventurer runs along a stone bridge toward a stone dungeon gate on the right, sword held forward with a cold blue edge-glow, determined face. Behind him on the left a green blocky zombie with red eyes, arms forward. Inside the gate's arch a gold key glows with a burst of light. Snowy blocky mountains behind, soft haze, warm torchlight on the gate. Rule of thirds: hero centre, gate and key right third. Empty sky across the top centre for a title."
negative: "text, letters, numbers, logo, watermark, signature, UI, frame, blood, gore, real brand characters, photorealistic people"
